sub677
00:46:57.320 --> 00:47:01.640
BP: Voll, frontal, wochenlang.

sub678
00:47:01.680 --> 00:47:04.400
KM: Ja, ich glaube
in der eigenen Partei,

sub679
00:47:04.440 --> 00:47:06.480
